ey setup, reports, plans","kind":"title1","maxW":3680},"t7":{"x":0,"y":8440,"text":"পরিবার ও সিস্টেম · Family, notifications, offline, account","kind":"title1","maxW":3680},"t8":{"x":0,"y":9740,"text":"Admin console · plans, audit, staff, health","kind":"title1","maxW":5280},"n4":{"x":3720,"y":6100,"w":520,"text":"Added from the SRS/BRD sweep: tutorial (FR-VOICE-10), Simple mode home (FR-VOICE-09), manual entry, detail/undo, receipt split, rule learning, no-voice fallback, accounts, categories, recurring, festival, reports, Probashi viewer, plans + payment, offline sync, notifications, family switch, delete-my-data, profile.","fill":"green","size":"m"},"n5":{"x":3720,"y":7400,"w":520,"text":"New ideas (not in the docs): Dhar tracker (BR-18 made concrete), shared bazaar list, \"I'm coming\" reply to a buzz, buzz from a budget alert, expenses shown in the family chat.","fill":"orange","size":"m"}}}
